      "statement": "CI seals its assembly-qualified targets into one immutable complete-product record with exact source, producer attempt, toolchain inputs, asset identities, and independently hashed Control bytes; current CI seals a Mac-only schema 5 record. Schema 2 COMPONENT_ASSEMBLY replaces the removed native test harness receipt. Detached installed-product receipts are joined without rewriting the record; sealing alone does not establish installed acceptance.",
